OL,3,ABoat carrying 267 people capsizes off
OL,4,Anorthern Cyprus
OL,5,
OL,6,FA passenger boat carrying 259
OL,7,Fpassengers and eight crew members has
OL,8,Fcapsized off northern Cyprus
OL,10,FThe Turkish Interior Ministry says the
OL,11,Fship began taking taking on water and
OL,12,F"was in danger of sinking at a location
OL,13,F4 nautical miles off Kyrenia Port"
OL,15,FA search and rescue operation
OL,16,Finitiated, it adds in a statement
OL,18,F"The situation is very serious," says
OL,19,FMurat Senkul, the mayor of the coastal
OL,20,Ftown of Kyrenia
